message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "ST-CRAAN: code for a nationwide out-of-time test of Earth observation for agricultural default forecasting"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a factorial of five model families across eight feature sets,
  fitted on a nationwide panel of Thai rice-cultivating borrowers and evaluated
  on a withheld crop season. Includes the branch-health diagnostics and
  modality-neutralisation tests used to detect silent modality collapse in a
  dual-branch forecaster, and the leave-one-out oracle that bounds any predictor
  whose environmental input is resolved to the sub-district.
